Disposition
The dedicated op is mathematically exact and faster, but correctness must hold
for all legal caller lifetimes. AutoFix exhausted the scoped layout, output
placement, lifetime, state and program-cache hypotheses; the remaining failure
is a current TTNN allocator/address-sensitive composition limitation that
cannot be repaired in fused_decoder.py. The correct primitive epilogue is
retained and the delivered source is restored to SHA-256 3f033b75dd81ee615bc8309e8e24dbc7aa43f3a6699dfc3bba596879fb7b9d3b.
